{
  "name": "Google Maps Lead Generator v2 (Serper.dev)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ One-time Setup\n\n**1. Get a Serper.dev API key**\nSign up free at [serper.dev](https://serper.dev) → Dashboard → API Key (2,500 free searches included).\n\n**2. Create a credential in n8n**\nCredentials → New → **Header Auth**\n- Name: `Serper.dev API`\n- Header Name: `X-API-KEY`\n- Header Value: _(paste your API key)_\n\n**3. Bind the credential**\nOpen the `Search Google Maps via Serper` node → Credential → select `Serper.dev API`.\n\n**4. Update your query list**\nEdit the pinned data on `Run Workflow` with your queries.\n\n**5. Update the Google Sheet target**\nOpen `Save to Google Sheet`, pick your document and sheet, ensure the sheet has an `emails` column header in row 1.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "11111111-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-111111111111",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [240, -60],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Why the old workflow broke\nGoogle Maps is a **JavaScript SPA** — a raw HTTP GET returns near-empty HTML. All URLs scraped were Google infrastructure (gstatic, ggpht, etc.), so the filter removed everything.\n\nThis version calls the **Serper.dev /maps API** which returns structured JSON including business website URLs directly from Google's index — no browser rendering needed.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "11111111-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-111111111111",
      "name": "Why v2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [980, -60],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "22222222-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-222222222222",
      "name": "Run Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [240, 400],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://google.serper.dev/maps",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "q",
              "value": "={{ $json.query }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "num",
              "value": "20"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "33333333-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-333333333333",
      "name": "Search Google Maps via Serper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [480, 400],
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Serper.dev API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "places",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "44444444-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-444444444444",
      "name": "Split Out Places",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "position": [720, 400],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-website-not-empty-001",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.website || '' }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "55555555-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-555555555555",
      "name": "Filter: Has Website",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [960, 400],
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": "website",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "66666666-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-666666666666",
      "name": "Remove Duplicate Websites",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "position": [1200, 400],
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.website }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "77777777-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-777777777777",
      "name": "Fetch Business Website",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [1440, 400],
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "alwaysOutputData": false,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// $json.data contains the raw HTML from the business website\nconst html = $json.data || ''\n\n// Regex: match emails, skip image file extensions mistaken as TLDs\nconst emailRegex = /[a-zA-Z0-9._%+-]+@[a-zA-Z0-9.-]+\\.(?!png|jpg|gif|jpeg|svg|webp)[a-zA-Z]{2,}/g\n\nconst emails = html.match(emailRegex) || []\n\nreturn { json: { emails: emails } }"
      },
      "id": "88888888-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-888888888888",
      "name": "Extract Emails From Page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [1680, 400],
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-emails-gt-zero-001",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.emails.length }}",
              "rightValue": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "99999999-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-999999999999",
      "name": "Filter: Has Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [1920, 400],
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "emails",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "name": "Split Out Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "position": [2160, 400],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": "emails",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bbbbbbbb-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
      "name": "Remove Duplicate Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "position": [2400, 400],
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-not-spam-001",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notRegex"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.emails }}",
              "rightValue": "(google|gstatic|ggpht|schema\\.org|example\\.com|sentry\\.io|wixpress\\.com|noreply|no-reply|@sentry|@wix)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cccccccc-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-cccccccccccc",
      "name": "Filter Spam Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [2640, 400],
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
